&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Meet the Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Marketing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Creative Marketing team is the bridge between &lt;strong&gt;business, data, and creativity&lt;/strong&gt;, helping Fever’s experiences connect with audiences worldwide. We &lt;strong&gt;research, conceptualize, and craft campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;, producing audiovisual and digital content that brings our projects to life. By collaborating across teams, we ensure every experience is supported with creative strategies and insights that make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us &lt;/strong&gt;and help shape the ideas and content that define Fever’s global experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports to the Design &amp;amp; Video Senior Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creation of content in a variety of formats to be used across different channels (paid media, organic social media, out-of-home,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute motion graphics and animations that enhance brand storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modification of the content based on internal and client feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Storytelling skills to bring the content to life, working from a script and a storyboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Edit and produce high-end video content for campaigns across multiple platforms (TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work both with stock footage and in-house material.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pitch and present ideas and solutions to a creative brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research of new content formats, tools, and references to enhance the outcomes of the creative team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspire and motivate the team through continuously sharing inspiration and ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously optimize workflows, identifying areas where AI can accelerate processes and expand creative possibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position will be hybrid and based in Buenos Aires.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of Adobe Creative Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of digital marketing, Social Media, and the main formats and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative vision with the ability to merge storytelling, design, and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in video editing and motion graphics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High English proficiency (C1 or higher)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agency environment and familiarity with the creative processes involving clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing small teams is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with generative video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to accept constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player with a collaborative attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culturally sensitive and aware of trends in media, art, and design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in 3D or knowledge in spatial and retail design is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please include your portfolio when applying for this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;Why You’ll Love It Here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Attractive compensation package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;40% discount on all Fever events and experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Health and life insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;English lessons&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Gympass membership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vacation Bonus Aguinaldo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible remuneration with a 100% tax exemption through Cobee&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hybrid work model with and office in the heart of Buenos Aires&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Great work environment with a young, international team of talented people!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We have free food, drink, and fruit at the office!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
