&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;VIP Lead&amp;nbsp;to join the GSN Casino team&lt;/strong&gt;. The position can be based in Bangalore, India, Tel Aviv, Israel or Barcelona, Spain.&lt;/p&gt;
