&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is seeking a Group Director, Business Development to join our U.S.-based Growth team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a U.S. hybrid role, based in or near one of our U.S. hubs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for a seasoned business development leader who excels at leading&amp;nbsp;highimpact&amp;nbsp;pitches, supporting organic growth opportunities, and strengthening how teams come together to win new work. Reporting to the&amp;nbsp;Global&amp;nbsp;Head of&amp;nbsp;Business Development, the Group Director plays a key role in shaping and delivering compelling, integrated new business efforts across our healthcare portfolio&amp;nbsp;in partnership with corporate and capability teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
