&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and support priority new business pitches from RFI/RFP through final presentation, partnering closely with Client Leads, Growth Leaders, and&amp;nbsp;crossfunctional&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate client briefs into clear strategic frameworks and compelling pitch narratives aligned to Real Chemistry capabilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
